TypeScript Introduction:

- 🔥TypeScript has been around since 2012. It’s a superset of JavaScript, adding a few things to ES5. The
    most important one is the type system, giving TypeScript its name

- Writing TypeScript feels very much like writing JavaScript. By convention, TypeScript files are named
    with a .ts extension, and they will need to be compiled to standard JavaScript, usually at build time,
    using the TypeScript compiler. The generated code is very readable.

        npm install -g typescript
        tsc test.ts
